### REST Client file: click "Send Request" above each request (extension humao.rest-client).
### Start the backend first: uv run uvicorn app.main:app --reload

@backend = http://localhost:8000
@ollama = http://localhost:11434

### Backend health
GET {{backend}}/api/health

### Backend: installed models and the default chat model
GET {{backend}}/api/models

### Backend: chat with server defaults (the answer arrives as Server-Sent Events)
POST {{backend}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "Explique em 2 frases o que é streaming de tokens." }
  ]
}

### Backend: chat with a system prompt and explicit options
POST {{backend}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "qwen3:8b",
  "messages": [
    { "role": "system", "content": "Você é um analista de suporte. Responda em no máximo 3 linhas." },
    { "role": "user", "content": "Minha impressora aparece offline. O que eu verifico primeiro?" }
  ],
  "options": { "temperature": 0.7, "num_ctx": 4096, "max_tokens": 200, "think": false }
}

### Backend: model that is not installed (expect 404)
POST {{backend}}/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "nao-existe:1b",
  "messages": [{ "role": "user", "content": "Oi" }]
}

### Ollama: installed models
GET {{ollama}}/api/tags

### Ollama: models currently loaded in memory
GET {{ollama}}/api/ps

### Ollama: one non-streamed generation (look at eval_count and eval_duration in the response)
POST {{ollama}}/api/generate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "qwen3:8b",
  "prompt": "Explique em 3 frases o que é um token em um modelo de linguagem.",
  "stream": false,
  "think": false,
  "options": { "num_ctx": 8192, "temperature": 0.2 }
}
